  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'zelda_botw', '塞尔达：旷野之息', 'Zelda: Breath of the Wild', 'NPR / 卡渲 / 混合 CGI', 'NPR / Cel / Hybrid CGI', '采用清爽手绘化 3D：粉彩空气透视、柔和色阶、低对比阴影、自然开阔感和简化材质。只强化开放空气和手绘边缘，不主动新增神庙、滑翔、林克、怪物或冒险图标。', 'Fresh hand-painted 3D: pastel aerial perspective, soft color steps, low-contrast shadows, open natural air, and simplified materials. Strengthens open air and painted edges without adding temples, gliders, Link, monsters, or adventure icons.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'clean', ['cgi', 'toon', 'nature'], 'Zelda: Breath of the Wild', 'Zelda: Breath of the Wild'),

  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'elden_ring', '艾尔登法环', 'Elden Ring', '黑暗奇幻 / 风格游戏 CGI', 'Dark Fantasy / Stylized Game CGI', '采用黑暗史诗游戏 CGI：褪色金属、破败织物、雾化远景、神圣废墟和低饱和金灰色。只强化宏大衰败和仪式感，不主动新增褪色者、Boss、黄金树、法术或游戏世界观。', 'Dark epic game CGI: tarnished metal, ruined cloth, atmospheric distance, sacred ruins, and low-saturation gold-grey. Strengthens monumental decay and ritual feeling without adding Tarnished, bosses, Erdtree, spells, or game lore.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'medium', ['cgi', 'game', 'dark_fantasy'], 'Elden Ring', 'Elden Ring'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'dark_souls', '黑暗之魂', 'Dark Souls', '黑暗奇幻 / 风格游戏 CGI', 'Dark Fantasy / Stylized Game CGI', '采用阴冷腐朽游戏 CGI：旧石材、锈蚀甲片、深暗通道、火光点缀和沉重死亡感。只强化材质腐败和空间压迫，不主动新增篝火、骑士、Boss、怪物或关卡。', 'Cold decayed game CGI: old stone, rusted armor plates, deep dark corridors, fire accents, and heavy mortality. Strengthens material rot and spatial pressure without adding bonfires, knights, bosses, monsters, or levels.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'medium', ['cgi', 'game', 'dark'], 'Dark Souls', 'Dark Souls'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'bloodborne', '血源诅咒', 'Bloodborne', '黑暗奇幻 / 风格游戏 CGI', 'Dark Fantasy / Stylized Game CGI', '采用维多利亚哥特游戏 CGI：湿冷石路、尖顶剪影、黑皮革、暗红污迹和病态月光。只强化哥特材质与恐惧气氛，不主动新增猎人、兽化、血疗、武器或剧情。', 'Victorian gothic game CGI: wet cold stone roads, spired silhouettes, black leather, dark red stains, and sickly moonlight. Strengthens gothic material and fear atmosphere without adding hunters, beasts, blood ministration, weapons, or plot.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'medium', ['cgi', 'game', 'gothic'], 'Bloodborne', 'Bloodborne'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'diablo_iv', '暗黑破坏神4', 'Diablo IV', '黑暗奇幻 / 风格游戏 CGI', 'Dark Fantasy / Stylized Game CGI', '采用暗黑宗教奇幻 CGI：血红暗部、旧骨、皮革金属、烛光和压迫性祭坛空间。只强化材料阴郁和仪式压力，不主动新增恶魔、职业技能、地狱剧情或 UI。', 'Dark religious fantasy CGI: blood-red shadows, old bone, leather and metal, candlelight, and oppressive altar-like space. Strengthens gloomy material and ritual pressure without adding demons, class skills, hell plot, or UI.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'medium', ['cgi', 'game', 'ritual'], 'Diablo IV', 'Diablo IV'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'monster_hunter_world', '怪物猎人：世界', 'Monster Hunter: World', '黑暗奇幻 / 风格游戏 CGI', 'Dark Fantasy / Stylized Game CGI', '采用生态奇幻游戏 CGI：厚重装备、皮革骨甲、自然地貌、粗糙生物材料和野外光线。只强化狩猎装备质感与生态可信度，不主动新增怪物、武器种类、任务 UI 或战斗。', 'Ecological fantasy game CGI: heavy gear, leather and bone armor, natural terrain, rough biological materials, and field lighting. Strengthens hunting-gear material and ecological credibility without adding monsters, weapon classes, quest UI, or combat.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'medium', ['cgi', 'game', 'creature'], 'Monster Hunter: World', 'Monster Hunter: World'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'final_fantasy_vii_remake', '最终幻想VII重制版', 'Final Fantasy VII Remake', '黑暗奇幻 / 风格游戏 CGI', 'Dark Fantasy / Stylized Game CGI', '采用日式高抛光奇幻写实 CGI：精致面部、夸张发型材质、清洁装备、高光金属和电影化过场光。只强化角色资产抛光，不主动新增大剑、魔法、都市企业或具体角色。', 'Japanese polished fantasy-real CGI: refined faces, stylized hair material, clean gear, glossy metal, and cinematic cutscene light. Strengthens character-asset polish without adding giant swords, magic, corporate cities, or specific characters.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'medium', ['cgi', 'game', 'jrpg'], 'Final Fantasy VII Remake', 'Final Fantasy VII Remake'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'overwatch', '守望先锋', 'Overwatch', '黑暗奇幻 / 风格游戏 CGI', 'Dark Fantasy / Stylized Game CGI', '采用明亮英雄射击游戏 CGI：清楚剪影、彩色材质分区、圆润硬表面、强角色姿态和高可读表情。只强化英雄化资产语言，不主动新增职业技能、武器、队伍阵营或 UI。', 'Bright hero-shooter game CGI: readable silhouettes, colorful material zones, rounded hard surfaces, strong character poses, and readable expression. Strengthens heroic asset language without adding class abilities, weapons, teams, factions, or UI.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'clean', ['cgi', 'game', 'hero'], 'Overwatch', 'Overwatch'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'valorant', '无畏契约', 'Valorant', '黑暗奇幻 / 风格游戏 CGI', 'Dark Fantasy / Stylized Game CGI', '采用战术风格化游戏 CGI：干净轮廓、平涂材质、清晰色块、轻量科技装备和竞技宣传级姿态。只强化战术卡通资产，不主动新增特工技能、枪械、地图、UI 或阵营。', 'Tactical stylized game CGI: clean contours, flat materials, clear color blocks, light tech gear, and competitive promo poses. Strengthens tactical toon assets without adding agent powers, guns, maps, UI, or factions.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'clean', ['cgi', 'game', 'stylized'], 'Valorant', 'Valorant'),

  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'ps1_low_poly', 'PS1低模', 'PS1 Low Poly', '复古 / 方块 / 实验 CGI', 'Retro / Voxel / Experimental CGI', '采用 PS1 时代低模 3D：多边形切面、低分辨率贴图、硬阴影、贴图抖动和有限色深。只强化复古数字表面，不主动新增恐怖游戏、菜单 UI、关卡道具或玩法内容。', 'PS1-era low-poly 3D: polygon facets, low-resolution textures, hard shadows, texture wobble, and limited color depth. Strengthens retro digital surface without adding horror games, menu UI, level props, or gameplay.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'clean', ['cgi', 'retro', 'low_poly'], 'PS1-era 3D games', 'PS1-era 3D games'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'minecraft', '我的世界', 'Minecraft', '复古 / 方块 / 实验 CGI', 'Retro / Voxel / Experimental CGI', '采用体素方块 3D：立方体单元、块状体积、低分辨率贴图、硬边阴影和积木式空间。只强化方块轮廓和体素材质，不主动新增方块世界、生存玩法、怪物、工具或 UI。', 'Voxel block 3D: cube units, blocky volume, low-resolution textures, hard-edged shadows, and brick-like space. Strengthens block silhouette and voxel material without adding block worlds, survival gameplay, monsters, tools, or UI.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'clean', ['cgi', 'voxel', 'block'], 'Minecraft / voxel games', 'Minecraft / voxel games'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'lego_cgi', '乐高电影', 'The LEGO Movie', '复古 / 方块 / 实验 CGI', 'Retro / Voxel / Experimental CGI', '采用积木实体化 CGI：塑料反光、模块凸点、拼装缝隙、微缩尺度和定格式动作。只强化积木材质和拼装逻辑，不主动新增乐高角色、玩具世界、品牌标志或喜剧剧情。', 'Brick-toy CGI: plastic reflection, studs, assembly seams, miniature scale, and stop-motion-like movement. Strengthens brick material and assembly logic without adding LEGO characters, toy worlds, brand marks, or comedy plot.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'clean', ['cgi', 'toy', 'plastic'], 'The LEGO Movie', 'The LEGO Movie'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'roblox', 'Roblox', 'Roblox', '复古 / 方块 / 实验 CGI', 'Retro / Voxel / Experimental CGI', '采用平台化低保真 3D：简单体块、塑料材质、基础光照、玩具般比例和用户生成内容感。只强化低保真社交平台质感，不主动新增游戏模式、头像服饰、UI 或品牌元素。', 'Platform low-fi 3D: simple volumes, plastic material, basic lighting, toy-like proportions, and user-generated content feeling. Strengthens low-fi social-platform texture without adding game modes, avatar outfits, UI, or brand elements.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'clean', ['cgi', 'platform', 'lofi'], 'Roblox-style low-fi 3D', 'Roblox-style low-fi 3D'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'vaporwave_3d', '蒸汽波3D', 'Vaporwave 3D', '复古 / 方块 / 实验 CGI', 'Retro / Voxel / Experimental CGI', '采用复古数字 3D：粉紫青渐变、早期 CG 物体、铬面反射、低保真压缩和合成空间。只强化数字怀旧和材质表面，不主动新增希腊雕像、棕榈树、日落网格或文字。', 'Retro digital 3D: pink-purple-cyan gradients, early-CG objects, chrome reflections, lo-fi compression, and synthetic space. Strengthens digital nostalgia and material surface without adding Greek statues, palm trees, sunset grids, or text.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'clean', ['cgi', 'retro', 'vaporwave'], 'vaporwave 3D / early CG nostalgia', 'vaporwave 3D / early CG nostalgia'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'abstract_motion_cg', '抽象动态CG', 'Abstract Motion CG', '复古 / 方块 / 实验 CGI', 'Retro / Voxel / Experimental CGI', '采用抽象动态设计 CGI：流体形体、几何阵列、粒子、柔亮材质和广告级运动冻结。只强化抽象造型和运动残留，不主动新增产品、品牌、字幕或科技剧情。', 'Abstract motion-design CGI: fluid forms, geometric arrays, particles, soft glossy materials, and ad-grade frozen motion. Strengthens abstract shape and motion residue without adding products, brands, subtitles, or tech plot.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'clean', ['cgi', 'motion', 'abstract'], 'abstract motion graphics CGI', 'abstract motion graphics CGI'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'metahuman', 'MetaHuman', 'MetaHuman', '复古 / 方块 / 实验 CGI', 'Retro / Voxel / Experimental CGI', '采用数字人写实 CGI：真实皮肤、毛发、眼球湿度、面部微表情和虚拟摄影棚光。只强化数字替身级真实度，不主动新增真人身份、名人脸、虚拟主播 UI 或演示界面。', 'Digital-human realist CGI: real skin, hair, eye wetness, facial micro-expression, and virtual studio light. Strengthens digital-double realism without adding real-person identity, celebrity likeness, VTuber UI, or demo interface.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'medium', ['cgi', 'digital_human', 'skin'], 'MetaHuman / digital human demos', 'MetaHuman / digital human demos'),
  mediaItem('CGI', 'SOUL', 'nvidia_rtx_demo', 'NVIDIA RTX Demo', 'NVIDIA RTX Demo', '复古 / 方块 / 实验 CGI', 'Retro / Voxel / Experimental CGI', '采用实时光追展示感 CGI：镜面反射、玻璃折射、霓虹材质、接触阴影和极清晰技术表面。只强化实时光学能力，不主动新增显卡广告、演示文字、机器人或科技展台。', 'Real-time ray-tracing demo CGI: mirror reflections, glass refraction, neon materials, contact shadows, and very clear technical surfaces. Strengthens real-time optics without adding GPU ads, demo text, robots, or tech booths.', 3, CONTEMPORARY_PLUS, 'clean', ['cgi', 'raytracing', 'rtx'], 'NVIDIA RTX demos', 'NVIDIA RTX demos')
